{{zone|Dragontail Auction House}} is a sub-location of {{zone|Dragontail}}, on the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}. It works similarly to the [[Hub Island]] [[Auction House]].

It has 4 Top Auction displays, and is a tall wooden building. At the top, there is a bridge that connects to [[Yoink]]'s house.

